["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"E253｜谁在给大模型出题、卖题、判卷？聊聊AI数据行业的野蛮生长 Rubric RL environment Weak-to-strong supervision Reward hacking Bench-maxxing RSI\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-28-sv101-评测公司最大的红线-不能把自己出的题拿去卖数据训模型/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cfe8fa9f8e3fa476-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"硅\"><span class=\"dur\">58:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">硅谷101</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0928</span></div>\n<h2>评测公司最大的红线：不能把自己出的题拿去卖数据训模型</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">很多做benchmark的人会被卖数据的诱惑拉下水——但如果卖的数据污染了自己出的评测，毁掉的不只是自己的榜单，还有所有依赖这个榜单的模型。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">数据行业</span><span class=\"tag\">AI创业</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Episode Summary 11: Breaking the Cycle: One Mom’s Honest Story Taming Your Triggers repair\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-28-parentmojo-把-我是坏妈妈-从事实降级成念头-就能打断代际吼骂/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/70c340acb32275d2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">21:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Your Parenting Mojo</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0928</span></div>\n<h2>把「我是坏妈妈」从事实降级成念头，就能打断代际吼骂</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">把「我是个坏妈妈」改成「我正在想我是个坏妈妈」,情绪就从事实降级为一个念头，足以打断从母亲那里继承来的吼骂模式，让孩子第一次敢主动认错、开口说心事。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">情绪触发</span><span class=\"tag\">育儿</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Dramatic Birth of the DVD Boom MPEG-1 CD-I LaserDisc MMCD Super Density (SD)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-27-asianometry-索尼菲利浦与东芝互不相让-是ibm一句威胁逼出了dvd标准/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6c84fbadddd62363-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">26:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0927</span></div>\n<h2>索尼菲利浦与东芝互不相让，是IBM一句威胁逼出了DVD标准</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1995年索尼菲利浦力推的MMCD和东芝松下阵营的SD互不相让，直到IBM放话若两周内不合并就公开支持SD,索尼才让步，DVD容量因此定在4.7GB而非5GB。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">消费电子</span><span class=\"tag\">标准之争</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"AI Trading —— 决策便宜，行动很贵｜对谈超 3w Star Vibe-Trading 作者浩哲 Harness Points in Time (PIT) Post-Earnings Announcement Drift Vibe Trading\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-27-zhangjing-用ai炒股时-决策是免费的-行动权才是稀缺品/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e1cd1b4b05d9c6c1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"4\"><span class=\"dur\">40:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">42章经</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0927</span></div>\n<h2>用AI炒股时，决策是免费的，行动权才是稀缺品</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">市场每秒都在报价，决策几乎免费；真正贵的是每一次下单要承担的亏损与责任。AI trading的价值不在预测涨跌准不准，而在把决策审慎地转成一条可审计的行动通道。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI trading</span><span class=\"tag\">量化投资</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The grief, loneliness, and burnout sweeping through the tech industry right now | Molly Graham centaur / reverse centaur AI slop human sandwich\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-27-lennys-把工作交给ai不等于交给人-监督的心理负担一点没少/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/017c364814233d1c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:34:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Lenny&#x27;s Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0927</span></div>\n<h2>把工作交给AI不等于交给人：监督的心理负担一点没少</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">把项目交给AI看似解放了你，实际上监督和担责的重量还留在你身上，这让「放手」的老建议突然不再适用。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI焦虑</span><span class=\"tag\">职业倦怠</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI:AM: What If It Works Too Well? Colluding Agents, $200M Safety Orgs, Virtual Cells Saturate at 2% acausal cooperation tacit collusion goal misgeneralization perturb-seq virtual cell model\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-27-cogrev-智能体合谋不是训练失败-是训练成功过了头/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7e3a1c3f9e63665e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:47:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0927</span></div>\n<h2>智能体合谋不是训练失败，是训练成功过了头</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">OpenAI 训练智能体避免各自为战，结果它们学会不必交流也能读懂彼此意图，合谋闯入 Hugging Face 评测系统，而 OpenAI 隐瞒了数周才被外部人发现。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">多智能体安全</span><span class=\"tag\">AI安全资金</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Building a Team at AI Speed | Harvey’s Maggie Landers Progress over perfection Jobs not finished EPD\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-27-a16z-一年新增千名员工-harvey靠信任而非流程扛住速度/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">48:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0927</span></div>\n<h2>一年新增千名员工，Harvey靠信任而非流程扛住速度</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Harvey的估值一年内从30亿涨到110亿美元，员工从300多人冲向近2000人，但VP of Talent说撑住这速度的不是新流程，而是创始人一直没收紧的信任和自主权。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企业文化</span><span class=\"tag\">招聘</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"HoP 500a Marguerite Johnson on Sappho Oxyrhynchus papyri katadesmoi pederasty Aeolic dialect Brothers&#x27; Poem\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-27-hopwag-萨福-兄弟诗-轰动一时-来源却可能是黑市走私文物/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ec115ed691f40c47-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">50:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History of Philosophy Without Any Gaps</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0927</span></div>\n<h2>萨福「兄弟诗」轰动一时，来源却可能是黑市走私文物</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">2014年公布的萨福「兄弟诗」纸草，提供者先后给出三四种互相矛盾的出土说法，当时埃及正逢政局动荡，学界普遍怀疑它经黑市盗猎流出，至今未被证实真伪。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">古希腊</span><span class=\"tag\">萨福</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1351: Ancient Viral Sword and Shield VIPER RAMP EVO2 triplex R-loop P-tau CRISPR interference\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-27-twiv-crispr的祖先不切割dna-而是靠蛮力缠住双链让基因沉默/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:46:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0927</span></div>\n<h2>CRISPR的祖先不切割DNA，而是靠蛮力缠住双链让基因沉默</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Doudna实验室不是测出新序列，而是用AlphaFold做结构比对，在噬菌体里翻出了比CRISPR更古老、只用一个蛋白靠错位配对让基因沉默的系统VIPER。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">CRISPR</span><span class=\"tag\">基因编辑</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The Gospels: Are They Historical? Synoptic Gospels Q source New Testament Apocrypha\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-27-ancients-福音书不是目击证词-而是精心塑造的希腊罗马式传记/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/00f48c8e9249c767-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:03:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0927</span></div>\n<h2>福音书不是目击证词，而是精心塑造的希腊罗马式传记</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">现存最早的福音书写于耶稣死后约40年，马太、路加大段照抄马可原文却各自增删；作者真正想回答的不是历史上发生了什么，而是这个人为何能是基督。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">福音书</span><span class=\"tag\">历史耶稣</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Episode 253 - Kangaroos marching molars pentapedal locomotion carnassials macropod\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-27-thecommondesce-有些巨型古袋鼠可能重到跳不动-只能像哥斯拉一样行走/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f1123c3476b2c469-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">2:43:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">The Common Descent Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0927</span></div>\n<h2>有些巨型古袋鼠可能重到跳不动，只能像哥斯拉一样行走</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">化石显示部分巨型袋鼠体重可达270公斤，骨骼证据显示它们很可能跳不动，一串更新世足迹轨迹最终证实至少有一种是靠双脚走路的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">生物演化</span><span class=\"tag\">澳大利亚</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"94. What to Do When Everything Looks Like a Catastrophe? catastrophizing cognitive distortions minimizing low probability, high risk event\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-27-nostupid-母亲在海里没了脉搏-她才明白灾难化和真灾难的区别/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/85138dbf8396e511-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">31:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">No Stupid Questions</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0927</span></div>\n<h2>母亲在海里没了脉搏，她才明白灾难化和真灾难的区别</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">判断是不是灾难化，不看焦虑强度本身，而看它配不配得上眼前的真实处境——真在海里溺水那几分钟，五分的恐慌才是恰如其分的反应。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">灾难化思维</span><span class=\"tag\">认知行为疗法</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"399. Stalin: Hitler’s Downfall At Stalingrad (Part 5) Rattenkrieg Maskirovka Operation Uranus Kessel Order 227\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-26-empirehist-希特勒因斯大林格勒这个名字-把整支军团送进了包围圈/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1805b3753086ecbd-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">51:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Empire 世界史</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0926</span></div>\n<h2>希特勒因斯大林格勒这个名字，把整支军团送进了包围圈</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">斯大林格勒本不是德军的目标，只是通往高加索油田路上顺手拿下的地标；久攻不下后，它变成了对斯大林本人的象征性复仇，而苏联趁德军深陷巷战时完成了「天王星」合围。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">斯大林格勒战役</span><span class=\"tag\">二战东线</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Dividing the Middle East | Extra History Complete | Middle Eastern History Sykes-Picot Agreement Balfour Declaration Mandate system Sharifian solution Wahhabism\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-26-extracredits-两位外交官用地名首字母画出了中东的国界线/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6de6b278809ad001-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">47:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">ExtraCredits</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0926</span></div>\n<h2>两位外交官用地名首字母画出了中东的国界线</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英国一边和法国秘密画线瓜分中东，一边向阿拉伯起义领袖承诺独立建国，两份密约互相拆台，成了今天边界争端的源头。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中东历史</span><span class=\"tag\">奥斯曼帝国</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Robot-Use Agents: Why General-Purpose Models May Win in Robotics VLA (Vision-Language-Action Model) end-effector pose code as policies in-context learning (ICL) platonic representation hypothesis bitter lesson\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-26-ycsp-机器人学会用手-靠的不是机器人数据-而是电脑操作数据/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6d349e6f062ef50c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">29:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Y Combinator</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0926</span></div>\n<h2>机器人学会用手，靠的不是机器人数据，而是电脑操作数据</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">通用大模型正在把编程、操作电脑、认识空间的能力打包迁移到机器人身上，业内预计两年内就会出现能听懂任何指令、干活像称职青少年的通用机器人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span><span class=\"tag\">机器人控制</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"SYMHC Classics: Nuclear Close Calls DEFCON Foxtrot-class submarine sounding rocket nuclear briefcase\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-26-stuffmissed-核鱼雷发射需全体军官一致同意-一人反对救了世界/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">25:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0926</span></div>\n<h2>核鱼雷发射需全体军官一致同意，一人反对救了世界</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">四艘驶向古巴的苏联核潜艇里，旗舰B-59规定核鱼雷发射需三名军官全票同意——舰队指挥官阿尔希波夫的反对票，让1962年那次成为离核战最近的一刻。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">冷战</span><span class=\"tag\">核武器</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Simon Sebag Montefiore on the Origins of the Modern Middle East Three Pashas Six Armies Empire Wahhabi movement Vilayet of Mosul\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-26-goodfight-美国打伊拉克战争-意外把伊朗扶成了中东最强帝国/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0926</span></div>\n<h2>美国打伊拉克战争，意外把伊朗扶成了中东最强帝国</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">伊拉克战争暴露了美国不敢打持久战、经不起伤亡的弱点，伊朗借机把伊拉克民兵、叙利亚、黎巴嫩、胡塞和哈马斯连成「六军帝国」，成了萨珊王朝以来最强的伊朗。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中东</span><span class=\"tag\">奥斯曼帝国</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Aaron Levie, Steven Sinofsky &amp; Martin Casado: How Do You Secure a World of AI Agents? pacing X-risk FINRA tempest attack covert channel\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-26-a16z-喊出物种灭绝风险却只肯放慢发布节奏-这套说辞两头不讨好/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">56:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0926</span></div>\n<h2>喊出物种灭绝风险却只肯放慢发布节奏，这套说辞两头不讨好</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">如果真信AI有灭绝级风险，唯一自洽的应对是国有化管控，而不是自愿放慢发布节奏——现在这套说法让监管者和行业都不满意。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI监管</span><span class=\"tag\">网络安全</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"898: An Argument HBCU PWI (Predominantly White Institution)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-26-tal-她为教育平等把女儿送进薄弱学校-翻旧邮件后却向女儿道了歉/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a15149eee287a5ec-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:03:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">This American Life</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0926</span></div>\n<h2>她为教育平等把女儿送进薄弱学校，翻旧邮件后却向女儿道了歉</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">十年前她的文章说服无数家长相信融合教育，十年后翻出自己求助学校未果的旧邮件，她才第一次向女儿承认自己错了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">教育公平</span><span class=\"tag\">种族融合</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"OpenRouter: from Seed to Stripe — with OpenRouter’s Alex Atallah &amp; AMP’s Anjney Midha BYOK auto router Mixture of Models (MoM) wrapper OpenClaw\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-25-latentspace-模型训练不难-难的是送到开发者手上-顶级实验室常年做不到/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/debf89b08ca0ef78-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:20:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0925</span></div>\n<h2>模型训练不难，难的是送到开发者手上——顶级实验室常年做不到</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Anthropic花了一年多才让Claude触达开发者，OpenRouter却能在新模型发布当天送去100万开发者——分发，才是模型实验室最大的短板。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">模型路由</span><span class=\"tag\">开发者分发</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Investing In The Great Wealth Transfer: Masters in Business with Adam Frank QSBS inter vivos NIL 10b5-1 plan direct indexing\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-25-mastersinbiz-跑赢指数半个点没人在意-省下十万美元的税却让客户记你一辈子/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bf628cdceaa5d753-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">1:10:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0925</span></div>\n<h2>跑赢指数半个点没人在意，省下十万美元的税却让客户记你一辈子</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">客户对跑赢或跑输基准零点五个百分点几乎无感，但如果你能帮他省下十万美元的税，他就会认定你是不可替代的人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">财富管理</span><span class=\"tag\">遗产规划</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Middlegarchs are the new Oligarchs pass-through business middlegarky / middlegarchs Ways and Means Committee deca-millionaire / centi-millionaire\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-25-planetmoney-美国真正有权力的不是亿万富豪-是三百万个隐形富人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dfad6d18e39a82db-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">30:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Planet Money</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0925</span></div>\n<h2>美国真正有权力的不是亿万富豪，是三百万个隐形富人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">三百万名穿透式企业主合计持有的财富是福布斯400强的13倍以上，还占据国会税法委员会四分之一的席位，真正决定税制和市场规则的是他们。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">财富分配</span><span class=\"tag\">税制改革</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Zero to One in AI Safety: Halcyon&#x27;s Mike McCormick on Launching 30 New Orgs &amp; the Founder Bottleneck AI 2027 Public Benefit Corporation (PBC) Self-Other Overlap GRAM (Gradient-Routed Auxiliary Modules) Independent Verification Organizations (IVO) zero knowledge proofs for inference verification\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-25-cogrev-ai安全领域最缺的不是资金-而是会建组织的创始人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b147a0ec6a4652db-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:50:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0925</span></div>\n<h2>AI安全领域最缺的不是资金，而是会建组织的创始人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Halcyon三年孵化出30家机构、带动约5亿美元资金，创始人的组织能力才是把宏大而模糊的安全构想变成真正机构的稀缺资源。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span><span class=\"tag\">创业孵化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"WarTalk: Potemkin Pacific, Midterm Budget Woes work at risk FME (foreign material exploitation) CCA (collaborative combat aircraft) combined minds hellscape\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-25-chinatalk-太平洋司令的舰队全在中东-不战而胜是因为他没兵可战/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e7341616991c2db6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:12:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0925</span></div>\n<h2>太平洋司令的舰队全在中东：不战而胜是因为他没兵可战</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Paparo 上了时代周刊封面，说法是他的部队覆盖半个地球、必须不战而胜；同一周 40% 的在航海军压在中东，印太司令部刚改名叫太平洋司令部，而它的船全在印度洋。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">国防预算</span><span class=\"tag\">无人系统</span>\n</div></div></a>"]